mctrace 1
profile 1
precision f32
tick 1 time 41800000 dt 00000000
tile 0 site 0 args 0 result bool 1
tile 1 site 1 args 0 result nil
port i2c write 10 0b
tick 2 time 42000000 dt 41800000
tile 0 site 0 args 0 result bool 1
tile 1 site 1 args 0 result nil
port i2c write 10 0c
tick 3 time 42400000 dt 41800000
tile 0 site 0 args 0 result bool 1
tile 1 site 1 args 0 result nil
port i2c write 10 0d
